                                                "sense_id": "b67f684c-34ce-37c9-aae1-9a8d28941589",
                                                "text": "You may not have heard of the last blow—Julia's elopement; she is gone to Scotland with Yates."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8484c37b-c4d8-4471-b1d7-30ce6bce1dbc",
                                                "sense_id": "b67f684c-34ce-37c9-aae1-9a8d28941589",
                                                "text": "[…] Jo […] was already deep in the concoction of her story, being unable to decide whether the duel should come before the elopement or after the murder."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
